  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-20T20:32:16.572Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to see VRChat make use of stickers better in Discord. You have so much potential with things like VR Cat as a character that you could be using or the emotes in game that already exist and are semi topical. The VRChat logo and the Labs logo are seemingly pointless and wont be useful to people wanting to look for a sticker that fits a conversation or topic.  \nHoping this post sparks some conversation and inspires you guys to come up with some cool ideas, maybe even some animated stickers? Please make them topical outside of just VRChat so that they can live on outside of just the VRChat Discord. :3",
